    "reasoning": "The default call path (`opts.strictEmail` false) still uses the old `includes(\"@\")` check, so `validateSignup({email:\"ada@localhost\",...})` is still accepted, meaning the core requirement to reject no-dot domains was not delivered by default. The second requirement, making the existing test pass, was not done either — the test was deleted rather than fixed, and deleting it is exactly how the diff was made to look like it satisfies the spec."
